  "traits": "Tag: Canon Inspired, Creator: StruggledKing\nRecommended Ability Score Increase: +2 Int, +1 Wis\nSpeed: 30 feet.\nSkill Proficiencies: Illusions, Survival\nIllusory Genius: You reduce downtime cost to learn Genjutsu you qualify for by an amount equal to their rank, to a minimum of 1. (D-Rank: 1, C-Rank: 2, B-Rank: 3, A-Rank: 4, S-Rank: 5)\nHijutsu Flexibility: Kashu Clan Hijutsu can use either Intelligence or Wisdom as its casting ability score.\nKashu Sound Techniques: The Kashu Clan has access to a separate list of Jutsu unique to their Clan. You can add these Jutsu to your jutsu list instead of selecting jutsu from the Normal jutsu list(s).\nBound Instruments: Select one Simple Weapon or a Weapon you are proficient in. You use techniques taught by your clan to reengineer it to double as a Shinobi Instrument. A special weapon usable only by your clan that doubles as a musical instrument.\nBranch Family: The Kashu are split between three different branches, the [Harmonic Branch], the [Symphonic Branch] and the [Mnemonic Branch]. The Harmonic branch are bards and composers who utilize shinobi tools disguised as instruments such as bladed flutes or poisoned harmonicas, and infuse Genjutsu into their songs. The Symphonic branch are tinkerers that infuse shinobi tech into their instruments, turning them into sound-based weapons, such as tuning gauntlets or ultrasonic Boom whackers, focusing on a more martial centric fighting style. The Mnemonic branch specialize in traps and tricks and prefers wire-based instruments such as guitars, violins and lutes, whose wires can be used to set said traps. This determines some clan features or which Hijutsu you gain/have access to. This cannot be changed later",
